  "body": "1. In a future version we need to stop reading & writing to the `event_txn_id` table & bump the schema version.\r\n2. In a future future version, bump the minimum schema version to the new version in step 1 & drop the `event_txn_id` table.\r\n3. In step 2, we can also stop writing the access token ID into the internal metadata for events.\r\n\r\nSee https://github.com/matrix-org/synapse/pull/15629#discussion_r1279686691",
